	(text "THE GRAPHICS SHIFT REGISTERS AND THEIR LOAD, THE DELAY LINE, THE TWO LAYERS MIXED, THE DOT RETIMED" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e02055fe-58ad-5b85-a47e-e11368858010"))
	(text "IC22 / IC23 load the RAM's word in dot 7 of a Background cycle with the display on (GLOAD, IC38/B) and shift\nit out bit 0 first; a word fetched with the display off is not loaded, which is the blanking. IC40 delays the\ndot 8 dots, into step with the text. VIDN = NOT ((G OR T) AND NOT (G AND T AND TXOR)); IC37/B puts it on the\ndot clock. DISPWN (IC19/C) marks a Window cycle for method A. R19 holds the text dot low without its parts." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "777482a0-ad19-53a7-af32-aef22f4fd114"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
